  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jamaica Early Childhood Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project endorses the objectives of the National Strategic Plan.  Its development objectives are to:  improve parentingeducationand support programs; (ii) improve monitoring of children&#x2019;s development, the screening of household level risks, and therisk mitigation and early intervention systems, (iii) enhance the quality of early childhood schools and care facilities; and (iv)strengthen early childhood organizations and institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
